    "%@ was selected because it closes the remaining allocation for %@. It is an eligible %@ movement; the solver prioritizes %@, then compound coverage and style fit." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ wurde gewählt, weil es das verbleibende Kontingent für %@ schließt. Es ist eine passende %@-Bewegung; der Algorithmus priorisiert %@, dann Abdeckung durch Grundübungen und Stilpassung."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ was selected because it closes the remaining allocation for %2$@. It is an eligible %3$@ movement; the solver prioritizes %4$@, then compound coverage and style fit."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ was selected because it closes the remaining allocation for %@. It is an eligible %@ movement; the solver prioritises %@, then compound coverage and style fit."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Se eligió %@ porque cierra la asignación restante de %@. Es un movimiento de %@ válido; el algoritmo prioriza %@, luego la cobertura con ejercicios compuestos y el ajuste al estilo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ a été choisi car il comble l’allocation restante pour %@. C’est un mouvement %@ admissible ; l’algorithme privilégie %@, puis la couverture par les polyarticulaires et l’adéquation au style."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ is gekozen omdat het de resterende toewijzing voor %@ vult. Het is een geschikte %@-beweging; de solver geeft voorrang aan %@, daarna aan dekking met samengestelde oefeningen en stijl."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ foi escolhido porque fecha a alocação restante de %@. É um movimento de %@ elegível; o algoritmo prioriza %@, depois a cobertura com exercícios compostos e o encaixe no estilo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "选择%@是因为它能补足%@的剩余分配。它是符合条件的%@动作；算法优先考虑%@，然后是复合动作覆盖和风格匹配。"
