    },
    "Coach will replan this week to close: %@.\n\nTo fit them, Coach will go past its usual guardrails:\n%@\n\nYour call — Coach recommends, you decide. You can revert to the safe plan any time this week." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Der Coach plant diese Woche neu, um Folgendes zu schließen: %@.\n\nDafür geht der Coach über seine üblichen Leitplanken hinaus:\n%@\n\nDeine Entscheidung – der Coach empfiehlt, du entscheidest. Du kannst diese Woche jederzeit zum sicheren Plan zurückkehren."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Coach will replan this week to close: %1$@.\n\nTo fit them, Coach will go past its usual guardrails:\n%2$@\n\nYour call — Coach recommends, you decide. You can revert to the safe plan any time this week."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Coach will replan this week to close: %@.\n\nTo fit them, Coach will go past its usual guardrails:\n%@\n\nYour call — Coach recommends, you decide. You can revert to the safe plan any time this week."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "El Coach replanificará esta semana para cerrar: %@.\n\nPara que quepan, el Coach superará sus límites habituales:\n%@\n\nTú decides: el Coach recomienda, tú eliges. Puedes volver al plan seguro cuando quieras esta semana."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Le Coach va replanifier cette semaine pour combler : %@.\n\nPour y parvenir, le Coach dépassera ses garde-fous habituels :\n%@\n\nÀ vous de voir – le Coach recommande, vous décidez. Vous pouvez revenir au plan sûr à tout moment cette semaine."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "De coach plant deze week opnieuw om dit te dichten: %@.\n\nOm dat te laten passen, gaat de coach voorbij zijn gebruikelijke grenzen:\n%@\n\nJij beslist – de coach adviseert, jij kiest. Je kunt deze week altijd terug naar het veilige plan."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "O Coach vai replanejar esta semana para fechar: %@.\n\nPara encaixar tudo, o Coach vai além dos limites habituais:\n%@\n\nA decisão é sua — o Coach recomenda, você decide. Você pode voltar ao plano seguro a qualquer momento nesta semana."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "教练将重新规划本周以补足：%@。\n\n为此，教练会突破平常的保护限制：\n%@\n\n由你决定——教练只是建议。本周你随时可以恢复安全计划。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "教練將重新規劃本週以補足：%@。\n\n為此，教練會突破平常的保護限制：\n%@\n\n由你決定——教練只是建議。本週你隨時可以恢復安全計畫。"
          }
        }
      },
