    "Every coaching recommendation is grounded in peer-reviewed exercise science. This page documents the specific rules and citations the coach follows — the same rules covered by Cladiron's automated scientific validation suite." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Jede Coaching-Empfehlung beruht auf begutachteter Sportwissenschaft. Diese Seite dokumentiert die konkreten Regeln und Quellen, denen der Coach folgt – dieselben Regeln, die die automatisierte wissenschaftliche Validierung von Cladiron abdeckt."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Every coaching recommendation is grounded in peer-reviewed exercise science. This page documents the specific rules and citations the coach follows — the same rules covered by Cladiron's automated scientific validation suite."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Cada recomendación del Coach se basa en ciencia del ejercicio revisada por pares. Esta página documenta las reglas y citas concretas que sigue el Coach, las mismas que cubre la validación científica automatizada de Cladiron."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Chaque recommandation du Coach repose sur des études scientifiques évaluées par des pairs. Cette page documente les règles et sources précises qu’il suit – les mêmes que celles couvertes par la validation scientifique automatisée de Cladiron."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Elk coachadvies is gebaseerd op peer-reviewed bewegingswetenschap. Deze pagina documenteert de concrete regels en bronnen die de coach volgt – dezelfde regels die de geautomatiseerde wetenschappelijke validatie van Cladiron dekt."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Cada recomendação do Coach se baseia em ciência do exercício revisada por pares. Esta página documenta as regras e citações específicas que o Coach segue — as mesmas cobertas pela validação científica automatizada do Cladiron."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "每条教练建议都基于同行评审的运动科学。本页记录教练遵循的具体规则和引用——与 Cladiron 自动化科学验证覆盖的规则相同。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "每條教練建議都以同儕審查的運動科學為依據。本頁記錄教練遵循的具體規則與引用——與 Cladiron 自動化科學驗證涵蓋的規則相同。"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment" : "UI text shown in: Coach Methodology (Cadence/Cadence/Features/Coach/CoachMethodologyView.swift)"
    },
