    "If this is selected, take care of yourself and consider professional advice. The coach will avoid presenting hard recommendations." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wenn du dies auswählst, achte gut auf dich und hol dir ggf. professionellen Rat. Der Coach vermeidet dann harte Empfehlungen."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "If this is selected, take care of yourself and consider professional advice. The coach will avoid presenting hard recommendations."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Si lo seleccionas, cuídate y plantéate pedir consejo profesional. El Coach evitará proponer recomendaciones duras."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Si vous sélectionnez cette option, prenez soin de vous et envisagez de consulter un professionnel. Le Coach évitera de proposer des recommandations intenses."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Als je dit kiest, zorg dan goed voor jezelf en overweeg professioneel advies. De coach vermijdt dan zware adviezen."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Se selecionar isto, cuide-se e considere buscar orientação profissional. O Coach evitará recomendações pesadas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "如果选择此项，请照顾好自己并考虑寻求专业建议。教练将避免推荐高强度训练。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "若選擇此項，請照顧好自己並考慮尋求專業建議。教練將避免推薦高強度訓練。"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment" : "UI text shown in: Readiness Check In (Cadence/Cadence/Features/Home/ReadinessCheckInView.swift)"
    },
    "If you consistently avoid high-impact sessions (e.g. running), the coach deprioritizes them in favor of low-impact alternatives (walk, cycle, swim, row) that fulfill the same training intent. The avoidance tag is learned from the sessions you skip." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wenn du hohe Stoßbelastungen (z. B. Laufen) regelmäßig vermeidest, stuft der Coach sie zugunsten schonender Alternativen (Gehen, Radfahren, Schwimmen, Rudern) mit gleichem Trainingsziel herab. Diese Vermeidung lernt er aus den Einheiten, die du überspringst."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "If you consistently avoid high-impact sessions (e.g. running), the coach deprioritises them in favour of low-impact alternatives (walk, cycle, swim, row) that fulfil the same training intent. The avoidance tag is learned from the sessions you skip."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Si sueles evitar las sesiones de alto impacto (p. ej., correr), el Coach les resta prioridad en favor de alternativas de bajo impacto (caminar, pedalear, nadar, remar) con el mismo objetivo. Aprende esa preferencia de las sesiones que te saltas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Si vous évitez régulièrement les séances à fort impact (par ex. la course), le Coach les rétrograde au profit d’alternatives à faible impact (marche, vélo, natation, rameur) au même objectif. Il apprend cet évitement à partir des séances que vous sautez."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Als je zware impact (bijv. hardlopen) steeds vermijdt, geeft de coach daar minder voorrang aan ten gunste van alternatieven met weinig impact (wandelen, fietsen, zwemmen, roeien) met hetzelfde trainingsdoel. Dit leert hij uit de sessies die je overslaat."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Se você evita com frequência sessões de alto impacto (ex.: corrida), o Coach dá menos prioridade a elas em favor de alternativas de baixo impacto (caminhada, pedal, natação, remo) com o mesmo objetivo. Ele aprende isso com as sessões que você pula."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "如果你经常回避高冲击训练（例如跑步），教练会降低它们的优先级，改用目标相同的低冲击替代项（步行、骑行、游泳、划船）。这一回避标签是从你跳过的训练中学到的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "若你經常避開高衝擊訓練（例如跑步），教練會降低其優先順序，改用目標相同的低衝擊替代項目（步行、騎車、游泳、划船）。這個避開標籤是從你跳過的訓練中學到的。"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment" : "UI text shown in: Coach Methodology (Cadence/Cadence/Features/Coach/CoachMethodologyView.swift)"
    },
