    "Insights are computed on-device from your logged workouts and grounded in published training science. Coaching only — not medical advice." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Erkenntnisse werden auf dem Gerät aus deinen protokollierten Trainings berechnet und beruhen auf veröffentlichter Trainingswissenschaft. Nur Coaching – keine medizinische Beratung."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Insights are computed on-device from your logged workouts and grounded in published training science. Coaching only — not medical advice."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Las observaciones se calculan en el dispositivo a partir de tus entrenamientos registrados y se basan en ciencia del entrenamiento publicada. Solo coaching, no consejo médico."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Les observations sont calculées sur l’appareil à partir de vos entraînements enregistrés et reposent sur la science publiée. Coaching uniquement – pas un avis médical."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Inzichten worden op het apparaat berekend uit je gelogde trainingen en zijn gebaseerd op gepubliceerde trainingswetenschap. Alleen coaching – geen medisch advies."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Os insights são calculados no dispositivo a partir dos seus treinos registrados e se baseiam em ciência do treino publicada. Apenas coaching — não aconselhamento médico."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "洞察基于你记录的训练在设备端计算，并以已发表的训练科学为依据。仅为训练指导，并非医疗建议。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "洞察依據你記錄的訓練在裝置端計算，並以已發表的訓練科學為依據。僅為訓練指導，並非醫療建議。"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment" : "UI text shown in: Coach Insights (Cadence/Cadence/Features/Coach/CoachInsightsView.swift)"
    },
