    "The coaching engine is updated quarterly as new strength and hypertrophy research is published. Each update lists what changed and the studies behind it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Die Coaching-Engine wird vierteljährlich aktualisiert, wenn neue Forschung zu Kraft und Hypertrophie erscheint. Jedes Update listet die Änderungen und die zugrunde liegenden Studien auf."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "The coaching engine is updated quarterly as new strength and hypertrophy research is published. Each update lists what changed and the studies behind it."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "El motor del Coach se actualiza cada trimestre a medida que se publica nueva investigación sobre fuerza e hipertrofia. Cada actualización indica qué cambió y los estudios en que se basa."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
