    "The open free-exercise-db-plusplus package is pinned at version %@. Cladiron's interface, app-specific coaching composition, persistence, HealthKit integration, and Apple-platform experiences are covered by the GPLv3-or-later terms and App Store Exception above." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Das offene Paket free-exercise-db-plusplus ist auf Version %@ festgelegt. Cladirons Oberfläche, die app-spezifische Coaching-Zusammenstellung, Persistenz, HealthKit-Integration und die Apple-Plattform-Erlebnisse unterliegen den oben genannten Bedingungen der GPLv3 oder später und der App-Store-Ausnahme."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "The open free-exercise-db-plusplus package is pinned at version %@. Cladiron's interface, app-specific coaching composition, persistence, HealthKit integration, and Apple-platform experiences are covered by the GPLv3-or-later terms and App Store Exception above."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "El paquete abierto free-exercise-db-plusplus está fijado en la versión %@. La interfaz de Cladiron, la composición del Coach propia de la app, la persistencia, la integración con HealthKit y las experiencias en plataformas de Apple están cubiertas por los términos de la GPLv3 o posterior y la Excepción de App Store indicados arriba."
          }
